Sound Lab is an unofficial companion app for the minichord, an
open-source instrument by Benjamin Poilvé (https://minichord.com/,
https://github.com/BenjaminPoilve/minichord). The minichord's hardware
is licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 and its firmware under the 3-clause BSD
license by its author; this repository contains neither — it documents
and talks to them.
